<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "見えない光_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<TXSPN>I decided.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I will make sure of the truth of the matter with <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If my hypothesis is wrong, that is fine.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I am going to phone in order to make sure that it is wrong.<PG>
That's right, in this state of mind there is no way I can investigate properly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Let me rule out the possibility that <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> is involved, and then get down to investigating the incident in earnest.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
First some casual talk, and partway through a question that lays a trap: that would be best.<PG>
When I lifted my head, which I had been holding face-down,
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄切.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
my phone was lying right there by the pillow.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My hands were shaking. In this state, could I really manage casual talk?<PG>
I got up, stood in front of the mirror, and tried grinning from ear to ear as hard as I could.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yeah, it is fine.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I took one big, deep breath.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now then, on to carrying out the Operation.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
